    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22544" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γνωστός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, collat. form of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γνωτός</span> (q. v.), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>known</i>, <i><span class="en">
